Copyright 2026 Nizael Neves

Phibe is a modified fork of OpenJarvis (https://github.com/open-jarvis/OpenJarvis),
licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0. The original copyright and license
terms are preserved in the LICENSE file.

Changes made to the original work include: renaming the project to Phibe (formerly
Nova), removing unused messaging channels, the Rust extension, analytics, mining
and auto-update components, and rewriting the affected components in Python.

Third-party design assets bundled with the Phibe interface:
  - Inter typeface (SIL Open Font License 1.1), via @fontsource-variable/inter.
  - League Spartan typeface (SIL Open Font License 1.1), via @fontsource-variable/league-spartan.
  - Brand logos of connected services, from Iconify ("logos" and "simple-icons" sets, CC0). Logos belong to their owners and only identify each service.
  - Solar icon set by 480 Design (CC BY 4.0), via Iconify: https://icon-sets.iconify.design/solar/

Third-party software bundled for the Horizon Computer widget:
  - psutil 7.x (BSD 3-Clause). Copyright (c) 2009, Jay Loden, Dave Daeschler, Giampaolo Rodola. Reads processor, memory, disk, network, battery and process figures.
  - nvidia-ml-py 13.x (BSD), NVIDIA's Python bindings for its management library. Reads the graphics card's use, memory and temperature.
